## Automatically loaded by msync.bb from the script directory.
## One exact album name or artist/album relative path per line (case-sensitive).
## # Album excludes it; Album synchronizes it. Remove # to enable an album.
## Blank lines and ## instructions are ignored, including after indentation.
## Albums not listed are synchronized; an exclusion wins over a duplicate enabled entry.
## With --delete, excluded albums' selected-format destination files are removed.
## Run blacklist-all.sh [MUSIC_DIRECTORY] to start with all albums excluded.
